  "[says] (to Wang Lung) O-lan addresses Wang Lung's increasing expenses.",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"I took it for the house---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"How now, you fool---how now---\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"What have you done with the money---how much is left?\"",
  "Wang Lung (to O-lan): \"Tell me, is there enough---is there enough to buy a gold pin---\"",
  "O-lan (to Wang Lung): \"I took it for the house, I say. I have bought no new thing, not even a new shoe. I have bought only what was necessary, only the bedding and the bedding for the children.\"",
